# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mining 65-125
section Mining 65-125

step Smelt Bronze & Smelt Tin
  tip At 65 a Mining trainer teaches Smelt Bronze (2s; grey at 115) and Smelt Tin (50c; grey at 75): smelting at a forge raises Mining too, so smelt what you mine.
  learn 2659
  learn 3304

step Incendicite & Tin: Wetlands (65-125)
  only Human,Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Wetlands
  tip Mine every Copper (1, green), Incendicite (65, orange), Tin (65, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 125. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: Smelt Copper (orange to 25, grey at 70), Smelt Tin (grey at 75), Smelt Bronze (grey at 115) give points too. Smelt Bronze takes a Copper Bar and a Tin Bar each: keep bars from the smelts before it. Zone level 20-30. Expect about 130 nodes for these 60 points. Smelt Silver (2s; orange to 100, grey at 125) is taught from 75: learn it if you pass a Mining trainer, it is not worth a trip of its own.
  goto 32.6,47.9 "Copper, Tin" r 30
  goto 36.9,45.3 "Tin, Copper" r 30
  goto 43.6,45.3 "Copper, Tin" r 30
