step Artisan Mining
  tip Artisan Mining raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and no character level, and costs 5g: train it as soon as you reach 200. The arrow picks the nearest Mining trainer of your faction.
  train Mining Artisan

step Mithril: Badlands (200-230) cont.
  zone Badlands
  tip Mine every Iron (125, green), Gold (155, yellow), Mithril (175, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 230. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. Zone level 35-45. Expect about 90 nodes for these 30 points.
